WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.590
- So, Dean, what's something
no one knows about George

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:05.173
if you were gonna tell us that?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.110
- He don't have social media, do ya?

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.700
- You don't have social media?

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:10.533
- No, I don't.

00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:12.190
- How do you get away with that?

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.220
- I just never had it.

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:14.740
I had Facebook at school,

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:16.727
and then, I wasn't using
it so I got rid of it,

00:00:16.727 --> 00:00:18.800
and then, I remember when Twitter started.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:20.420
I remember my friend came round,

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.510
he was like, have you seen this?

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:23.010
It's basically like Facebook statuses,

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:24.500
but you can read celebrities'
Facebook statuses.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:26.700
And I don't know, okay.

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:27.930
And I just never, I never got on it,

00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.790
so I've, but maybe it's a good thing,

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:32.186
'cause I've just, I've seen
some of those selfies there.

00:00:32.186 --> 00:00:33.900
(laughing)

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.418
- Would you let your
parents take over your

00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:37.900
well, not yours.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.733
Would you let?

00:00:38.733 --> 00:00:40.420
You don't have one, but
if you did have one,

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.390
would you let your parents take over?

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.223
- Not in a million years.

00:00:42.223 --> 00:00:44.080
- You don't think it'd be funny?

00:00:44.080 --> 00:00:45.220
- No.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.120
I don't know what they'd post.

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:47.730
That'd be the worst
thing ever, wouldn't it?

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:48.563
- The unknown.

00:00:48.563 --> 00:00:49.396
- The unknown.

00:00:49.396 --> 00:00:51.360
- I feel like my mother
would be hilarious.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.520
Like it would just be random things

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:54.330
that she didn't realize she posted it,

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:55.790
and it would be great.

00:00:55.790 --> 00:00:57.640
I feel like it's something
I'm gonna do on Mother's Day.

00:00:57.640 --> 00:00:59.290
I'm gonna have her take
over my social media.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:00.123
- Yeah, you should.

00:01:00.123 --> 00:01:00.956
- Yes.

00:01:00.956 --> 00:01:02.925
It's gonna be just chaos.

00:01:02.925 --> 00:01:04.540
- And she wouldn't know that she posted,

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:06.860
I remember my mum, my dad,
the first camera phone

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:09.250
that he had, my mum looked
at it the wrong way around,

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.240
she went oh my God, there's a camera,

00:01:10.240 --> 00:01:11.803
and she looked down the lens like

00:01:11.803 --> 00:01:14.040
(laughing)

00:01:14.040 --> 00:01:16.040
- She was like I've got
it, I've almost got it.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:17.880
- It's all black, I can't see anything.

00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:19.903
- [Kelly] Something's
wrong with this phone.

